WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.040 --> 00:01.050
[Disclaimer: This series is created solely for entertainment purposes.

3
00:01.070 --> 00:02.320
All individuals, behaviors, places, and events depicted are entirely fictional,

4
00:02.340 --> 00:04.990
with no intention to represent or reference any organizations, departments, occupations, or individuals]

5
00:05.200 --> 00:06.460
Your medical history shows

6
00:06.480 --> 00:09.690
that you had a tumor near the brainstem.

7
00:10.010 --> 00:11.000
Sun!

8
00:11.020 --> 00:12.290
Don't worry.

9
00:12.500 --> 00:14.040
I did what you asked.

10
00:14.060 --> 00:16.490
But our relationship was wrong from the beginning.

11
00:16.520 --> 00:18.080
Stop talking,

12
00:18.410 --> 00:19.500
and listen to me.

13
00:20.400 --> 00:22.120
I do love you,

14
00:22.300 --> 00:24.700
but our relationship was wrong from the beginning.

15
00:25.310 --> 00:26.710
No...

16
00:26.730 --> 00:28.000
That's not true.

17
00:28.210 --> 00:30.080
What she said

18
00:30.440 --> 00:32.000
makes me think

19
00:32.540 --> 00:35.080
someone tampered with her memories.

20
00:36.890 --> 00:38.500
I'm sorry, Sun.

21
00:44.710 --> 00:48.590
♫Trapped in a love that's a fading image,♫

22
00:49.830 --> 00:52.310
What should I do to make her stay?

23
00:53.310 --> 00:55.400
Is it too late

24
00:56.010 --> 00:57.710
to tell her the truth?

25
01:01.310 --> 01:02.790
Stop talking,

26
01:03.200 --> 01:04.300
and listen to me.

27
01:07.890 --> 01:09.390
Let me help you.

28
01:12.200 --> 01:15.620
♫But who are you?♫

29
01:16.150 --> 01:17.370
♫...Please tell me♫

30
01:17.390 --> 01:18.600
What now, Sun?

31
01:20.910 --> 01:22.610
Just tell me your excuse already.

32
01:30.220 --> 01:33.010
I don't care how you remember me.

33
01:34.000 --> 01:35.300
All I ask is that you...

34
01:35.500 --> 01:37.710
remember my embrace.

35
01:39.050 --> 01:40.710
I want you to know

36
01:41.100 --> 01:43.400
I never meant to hurt you.

37
01:52.100 --> 01:53.500
I'm sorry

38
01:54.150 --> 01:57.000
I left you with someone evil like Nadear.

39
02:07.200 --> 02:10.260
[Third Person]

40
02:12.480 --> 02:21.810
♫The rain keeps splashing beneath our cover,♫

41
02:22.360 --> 02:27.490
♫Once it was a special place for two lovers♫

42
02:27.510 --> 02:31.120
♫There was never enough room for the third♫

43
02:31.770 --> 02:37.530
♫Now, the rain soaks our hearts together♫

44
02:37.550 --> 02:46.980
♫The question that's trapped in my heart♫

45
02:47.280 --> 02:52.440
♫Maybe it's time for you to do your part♫

46
02:52.470 --> 02:56.750
♫Choose the one your heart truly desires♫

47
02:56.770 --> 03:05.690
♫Before the last raindrop falls, don't make me shed another tear♫

48
03:06.050 --> 03:14.210
♫Before the last raindrop falls, don't make me shed another tear♫

49
03:48.610 --> 03:50.040
You're back, Chris?

50
03:56.610 --> 03:57.400
Nadear...

51
03:58.460 --> 03:59.890
I'm sorry.

52
04:00.510 --> 04:01.710
I'm so sorry...

53
04:06.800 --> 04:08.000
It's okay.

54
04:11.900 --> 04:15.010
Just having you back is enough for me.

55
04:50.310 --> 04:51.310
What the hell happened?

56
04:56.660 --> 04:58.690
How could Chris leave you?

57
04:59.600 --> 05:00.710
Was she...

58
05:01.400 --> 05:02.440
angry

59
05:02.590 --> 05:04.400
that you'd left her before?

60
05:08.600 --> 05:09.600
No.

61
05:10.920 --> 05:12.820
I haven't even told her that.

62
05:13.780 --> 05:15.880
Nadear made Chris leave me.

63
05:17.170 --> 05:18.110
How?

64
05:30.200 --> 05:31.390
What are you going to do?

65
05:32.810 --> 05:35.720
I have to find out what Nadear did to Chris.

66
05:36.300 --> 05:37.300
How?

67
05:45.500 --> 05:46.680
Didn't you tell me

68
05:46.700 --> 05:49.320
that Mrs. Chicha hired a private detective to look into her husband's affair

69
05:49.710 --> 05:51.000
and ended up filing for divorce?

70
05:51.800 --> 05:52.500
Uh-huh.

71
05:53.700 --> 05:55.490
When is she coming back to Thailand?

72
05:56.690 --> 05:57.910
I want to talk to her.

73
05:59.870 --> 06:01.290
What about your sickness?

74
06:01.320 --> 06:02.500
What are you going to do about it?

75
06:09.310 --> 06:10.310
I don't care.

76
06:10.990 --> 06:12.800
I have to save her.

77
06:13.410 --> 06:15.720
I won't let Chris stay with Nadear anymore.

78
06:50.270 --> 06:52.120
I hurt you again.

79
06:54.300 --> 06:57.100
Did Dr. Jeen make you remember everything?

80
07:01.870 --> 07:03.900
I thought I was a good person

81
07:04.610 --> 07:05.970
who never hurt anyone.

82
07:09.420 --> 07:11.010
Even after I broke up with you,

83
07:12.680 --> 07:15.070
I still stayed around to help you.

84
07:21.190 --> 07:22.410
I love Sun,

85
07:23.790 --> 07:25.700
but I've never dated her,

86
07:27.300 --> 07:28.800
because I'm waiting for the day

87
07:28.810 --> 07:30.910
we don't have to lie to your parents about our relationship anymore.

88
07:34.600 --> 07:37.490
What I never thought I'd do is...

89
07:38.300 --> 07:39.810
become the third person.

90
07:42.120 --> 07:44.110
Or make someone else the third person.

91
07:48.120 --> 07:49.700
But the truth is...

92
07:53.110 --> 07:54.900
I was doing all of that.

93
08:03.520 --> 08:04.990
But I don't get it.

94
08:07.160 --> 08:09.410
Why didn't you want me to know the truth?

95
08:13.600 --> 08:15.800
I just want us to start over

96
08:15.820 --> 08:17.910
and leave the pain behind.

97
08:23.510 --> 08:25.900
But I didn't know Sun would come back.

98
08:34.400 --> 08:35.610
I'm sorry

99
08:39.480 --> 08:41.500
for what happened, both then and now.

100
08:44.390 --> 08:45.700
I promise

101
08:47.050 --> 08:48.700
I won't hurt you again.

102
08:58.410 --> 09:00.710
Then let's make things right.

103
09:04.600 --> 09:05.660
From now on,

104
09:05.680 --> 09:07.800
there will be just the two of us.

105
09:11.910 --> 09:13.510
I love you, Chris.

106
09:15.810 --> 09:17.610
Can you sleep with me tonight?

107
09:31.260 --> 09:33.100
I ended things with Sun

108
09:34.400 --> 09:36.420
because she was the other woman.

109
09:38.220 --> 09:40.410
But I can't date you either,

110
09:43.700 --> 09:45.590
because I don't love you...

111
09:55.800 --> 09:58.300
When I said I wouldn't hurt you again,

112
09:58.760 --> 09:59.600
I meant...

113
10:02.300 --> 10:04.900
I don't want you to get your hopes up.

114
10:08.510 --> 10:10.700
Why did you come back, then?

115
10:16.520 --> 10:17.810
I came to apologize to you.

116
10:25.080 --> 10:27.580
Can you stay with me?

117
10:29.200 --> 10:31.720
Even if it's just as a friend is fine.

118
10:41.810 --> 10:42.500
Alright,

119
10:44.400 --> 10:46.290
I'll keep you company.

120
10:48.420 --> 10:49.700
I'll be in my room.

121
10:50.200 --> 10:51.300
Let me know if you need anything.

122
12:13.280 --> 12:14.300
I have something for you.

123
12:16.610 --> 12:17.890
Guess what it is.

124
12:21.830 --> 12:22.840
Flowers?

125
12:25.230 --> 12:26.730
What's the occasion?

126
12:28.670 --> 12:29.870
It's not flowers.

127
12:31.160 --> 12:31.950
Want to know what it is?

128
12:32.500 --> 12:33.190
Mm.

129
12:33.600 --> 12:34.600
Close your eyes.

130
12:36.800 --> 12:37.640
Open your hand.

131
12:41.810 --> 12:42.810
Now, open your eyes.

132
12:45.950 --> 12:47.600
I made this scented candle myself.

133
12:47.960 --> 12:49.010
It's tulip-scented.

134
12:50.000 --> 12:52.080
When you come home tired after a long day at work,

135
12:52.620 --> 12:54.210
the tulip scent can help.

136
13:02.630 --> 13:03.920
I feel refreshed.

137
13:05.370 --> 13:06.400
I told you

138
13:06.410 --> 13:08.400
the scent would help.

139
13:10.610 --> 13:12.210
You're the one who helped me.

140
13:18.610 --> 13:19.400
Chris...

141
13:19.600 --> 13:21.100
Please come back to me soon.

142
13:32.500 --> 13:33.820
Do I have to get rid of her...

143
13:35.700 --> 13:37.800
for Chris to love me?

144
13:57.030 --> 13:59.980
You want me to look into this woman

145
14:00.200 --> 14:01.200
for what, exactly?

146
14:01.440 --> 14:02.920
I want to know everything she does

147
14:03.290 --> 14:04.840
and everyone she knows.

148
14:11.210 --> 14:14.640
Is there any specific information you'd like to know?

149
14:15.000 --> 14:16.480
I don't know either.

150
14:17.020 --> 14:18.400
But that's exactly why

151
14:18.990 --> 14:21.990
I need to know everything about her.

152
14:23.410 --> 14:25.390
Whatever she's planning to do

153
14:25.410 --> 14:26.690
or how she does it.

154
14:29.200 --> 14:30.910
Seeing your expression

155
14:30.990 --> 14:32.380
makes me a little worried.

156
14:32.710 --> 14:35.310
I'm not helping out a villain, right?

157
14:37.980 --> 14:40.300
You might think I'm a villain,

158
14:40.660 --> 14:42.610
but what you're doing

159
14:43.300 --> 14:45.410
will definitely save someone.

160
15:12.900 --> 15:13.900
Serves you right.

161
15:14.210 --> 15:15.440
I told you,

162
15:15.690 --> 15:17.400
if you'd approached her directly

163
15:17.710 --> 15:19.620
and told her everything outright,

164
15:19.900 --> 15:21.420
things would've been a lot easier.

165
15:22.490 --> 15:23.270
No,

166
15:23.450 --> 15:24.990
if I'd approached Chris

167
15:25.510 --> 15:26.910
and told her the truth outright,

168
15:30.400 --> 15:33.480
this would've happened before she ever fell in love with me.

169
15:34.580 --> 15:35.400
Ugh!

170
15:35.500 --> 15:37.400
Can you stop speaking in riddles?

171
15:38.160 --> 15:40.130
You still haven't told me

172
15:40.150 --> 15:41.910
what happened to Chris yesterday.

173
15:45.570 --> 15:46.610
It's hard to explain.

174
15:47.700 --> 15:49.530
I can hardly believe it myself.

175
15:50.590 --> 15:52.530
What happened, then?

176
15:53.200 --> 15:54.800
Chris remembered

177
15:57.100 --> 15:59.920
that I was the other woman in her relationship with Nadear.

178
16:00.210 --> 16:00.990
What?!

179
16:02.800 --> 16:04.210
Don't ask me why.

180
16:04.890 --> 16:06.890
I'm trying to figure that out myself.

181
16:20.200 --> 16:21.610
Hey, Kiiro.

182
16:26.020 --> 16:26.690
Chris,

183
16:26.756 --> 16:28.900
I ordered some coffee for you. Do you want it now?

184
16:30.400 --> 16:31.420
Nadear...

185
16:32.110 --> 16:33.600
This isn't Kiiro.

186
16:37.830 --> 16:39.000
You can tell?

187
17:03.930 --> 17:07.560
[Aquatic Veterinary Hospital]

188
17:10.700 --> 17:11.500
Hello?

189
17:13.900 --> 17:14.900
Then...

190
17:19.260 --> 17:22.910
do you know where I can find a similar-looking fish?

191
17:26.210 --> 17:28.100
It took me so long

192
17:28.120 --> 17:30.710
to find a fish that looks like Kiiro.

193
17:31.910 --> 17:34.190
But you could still tell the difference.

194
17:34.700 --> 17:35.820
I'm a little disappointed...

195
17:38.500 --> 17:39.810
Why did you do this?

196
17:42.110 --> 17:43.470
If I hadn't found out,

197
17:43.500 --> 17:45.800
would you still have kept hiding the truth from me?

198
17:47.120 --> 17:49.650
I just didn't want you to be sad.

199
17:54.190 --> 17:55.280
Can you stop trying to protect me

200
17:55.290 --> 17:57.320
by lying to me like this, Nadear?

201
18:00.520 --> 18:02.290
I raised Kiiro myself.

202
18:03.620 --> 18:06.110
If it died, I want to know how.

203
18:07.800 --> 18:09.600
I want to be able to grieve for it, too.

204
18:11.410 --> 18:12.720
Don't act like it didn't matter

205
18:12.730 --> 18:14.800
and replace it so easily.

206
18:19.490 --> 18:21.410
Whether it's a fish or a dog,

207
18:22.700 --> 18:24.600
there's only one Kiiro for me.

208
18:44.390 --> 18:47.220
[Third Person]

209
18:48.779 --> 18:51.259
[Third Person]

210
19:06.959 --> 19:08.149
Jeen...

211
19:13.639 --> 19:15.059
Are you alright?

212
19:16.459 --> 19:17.819
What's wrong?

213
19:18.769 --> 19:20.339
I'm just scared.

214
19:25.489 --> 19:26.579
Is it because of me?

215
19:40.209 --> 19:41.759
It was my fault.

216
19:41.779 --> 19:43.249
I betrayed you.

217
19:46.369 --> 19:47.699
I'm sorry.

218
19:50.269 --> 19:52.289
I won't do it again.

219
20:00.759 --> 20:01.969
Good...

220
20:04.059 --> 20:06.259
Then can you tell me

221
20:07.669 --> 20:10.119
if the memories you've given Chris

222
20:11.779 --> 20:14.499
will always stay that way?

223
20:17.309 --> 20:19.349
Nothing else will interfere with

224
20:20.279 --> 20:22.369
her memories again, right?

225
20:25.969 --> 20:28.049
Chris just knows more now.

226
20:30.059 --> 20:32.139
She knows you're her girlfriend.

227
20:33.859 --> 20:36.069
And that Sun is the other woman in this relationship.

228
20:39.299 --> 20:42.369
That's how she'll remember things

229
20:45.659 --> 20:48.579
as long as you keep taking care of her like you used to.

230
20:52.769 --> 20:53.769
And...

231
20:55.059 --> 20:56.959
bring her to see me as usual.

232
21:00.139 --> 21:01.269
Alright.

233
21:06.159 --> 21:09.289
As long as Chris doesn't get back with Sun,

234
21:10.249 --> 21:11.849
I still have hope.

235
21:13.969 --> 21:14.939
What about me?

236
21:17.969 --> 21:19.899
I'm living

237
21:20.969 --> 21:22.779
for you right now, Jeen.

238
21:34.689 --> 21:36.909
You don't have to do this.

239
21:40.379 --> 21:42.379
You've helped me out,

240
21:45.759 --> 21:48.059
so let me help you for once.

241
21:57.469 --> 21:58.469
I know...

242
21:59.059 --> 22:00.059
you want this.

243
22:02.789 --> 22:05.069
Can I ask you something?

244
22:05.669 --> 22:06.559
Hm?

245
22:15.169 --> 22:17.709
Can you make Chris love me

246
22:20.649 --> 22:23.739
the way you love me?

247
22:32.179 --> 22:33.459
That way...

248
22:34.969 --> 22:36.559
you can love me

249
22:37.859 --> 22:39.469
however you want.

250
22:47.469 --> 22:50.119
[Third Person Bar - Bistro]

251
22:58.289 --> 22:58.979
Come in.

252
22:59.709 --> 23:00.879
Chris!

253
23:00.899 --> 23:03.019
A customer wants to speak to the manager.

254
23:03.359 --> 23:05.859
She said there's something wrong with the flower in her food.

255
23:06.359 --> 23:07.979
Chris... Help me, please.

256
23:08.009 --> 23:09.859
She's so scary.

257
23:10.259 --> 23:11.559
I'll go check it out.

258
23:14.179 --> 23:15.179
Um...

259
23:15.959 --> 23:17.269
She's over there.

260
23:22.069 --> 23:23.559
Wawah, you can get back to work.

261
23:23.859 --> 23:24.859
I can take care of this.

262
23:26.059 --> 23:27.059
Okay.

263
23:38.169 --> 23:39.969
Could you tell me what's wrong with the dish?

264
23:49.779 --> 23:51.869
Well...

265
23:53.369 --> 23:55.759
I've had better elsewhere.

266
24:00.469 --> 24:02.459
Then you should go back to that place.

267
24:15.249 --> 24:16.659
That's why I came here.

268
24:19.659 --> 24:21.369
You must be mistaken.

269
24:22.359 --> 24:23.879
You were never here.

270
24:24.759 --> 24:26.259
But the place I came from...

271
24:28.359 --> 24:29.459
had you in it.

272
24:31.769 --> 24:32.769
Sun...

273
24:35.989 --> 24:38.359
I don't want to make the same mistake.

274
24:41.459 --> 24:42.459
I know.

275
24:44.729 --> 24:45.749
And?

276
24:48.859 --> 24:51.359
Neither do I.

277
24:58.719 --> 24:59.749
Why are you here?

278
25:01.969 --> 25:02.969
I miss you.

279
25:05.079 --> 25:06.079
I want to see you.

280
25:33.059 --> 25:34.059
That's all.

281
25:35.859 --> 25:36.859
I'll...

282
25:37.359 --> 25:38.359
I'll get going now.

283
25:40.799 --> 25:41.889
Thank you so much.

284
25:46.299 --> 25:48.249
Take care, alright?

285
25:48.449 --> 25:52.279
♫Trapped in a love that's a fading image,♫

286
25:52.299 --> 25:56.059
♫Yet the love that never faded♫

287
25:56.079 --> 26:02.529
♫Like a missing page I can't find♫

288
26:02.549 --> 26:05.549
♫Your smell lingers vividly in my mind♫

289
26:05.569 --> 26:12.269
♫The touch from when you were by my side♫

290
26:12.349 --> 26:15.839
♫You're still so clear in my heart♫

291
26:15.859 --> 26:19.419
♫But who are you?♫

292
26:19.669 --> 26:22.459
♫...Please tell me♫

293
26:48.179 --> 26:51.179
[Private Investigator]

294
26:57.789 --> 26:58.679
Alright.

295
26:59.259 --> 27:00.949
Can we meet today?

296
27:07.109 --> 27:08.739
Ever since the accident,

297
27:09.349 --> 27:10.569
Chris and Nadear

298
27:10.579 --> 27:12.559
haven't posted any photos on social media.

299
27:14.269 --> 27:16.069
They've left all their group chats.

300
27:17.469 --> 27:19.459
No one except their parents

301
27:19.669 --> 27:21.869
can get in touch with them anymore.

302
27:23.469 --> 27:25.729
It's like they want to cut ties with their old lives.

303
27:31.269 --> 27:34.699
The private investigator Chicha recommended sure is the real deal, huh?

304
27:37.119 --> 27:38.659
So what are you gonna do next?

305
27:45.769 --> 27:47.869
No matter what I say,

306
27:48.869 --> 27:50.449
Chris won't believe me.

307
28:14.659 --> 28:16.169
I love you, Nadear.

308
28:20.469 --> 28:22.049
Well done, Jeen.

309
28:23.919 --> 28:25.799
I felt so satisfied

310
28:25.819 --> 28:27.459
when I saw Chris turn her back on Sun.

311
28:28.959 --> 28:31.059
I should've done this a long time ago.

312
28:38.959 --> 28:39.959
Where are you going?

313
28:43.759 --> 28:45.339
You already know where.

314
28:49.359 --> 28:51.369
Be a good girl, alright?

315
29:06.639 --> 29:07.459
Nadear?

316
29:14.679 --> 29:15.679
So,

317
29:16.269 --> 29:17.379
my sister

318
29:17.859 --> 29:19.569
wants to be a lapdog

319
29:20.199 --> 29:21.359
instead of a doctor?

320
29:23.479 --> 29:24.869
Why are you here, Prung?

321
29:25.279 --> 29:27.209
I came to warn you.

322
29:27.609 --> 29:29.159
You're the other woman

323
29:29.179 --> 29:30.549
in this relationship now.

324
30:15.349 --> 30:17.349
I don't want to make the same mistake.

325
30:18.959 --> 30:21.159
Neither do I.

326
30:22.659 --> 30:23.759
Why are you here?

327
30:24.659 --> 30:25.659
I miss you.

328
30:27.249 --> 30:28.649
I want to see you.

329
30:49.859 --> 30:51.469
[Chris]

330
30:51.479 --> 30:52.739
[Decline Call]

331
31:06.659 --> 31:09.139
Could my memories be distorted

332
31:09.149 --> 31:10.839
or incomplete?

333
31:15.759 --> 31:18.339
I can't believe I cheated

334
31:19.159 --> 31:22.159
and loved the other woman as much as I loved Sun.

335
31:33.099 --> 31:34.029
[Could my memories be distorted

336
31:34.039 --> 31:34.859
or incomplete?]

337
31:34.879 --> 31:35.879
[I can't believe I cheated

338
31:35.889 --> 31:36.869
and loved the other woman as much as I loved Sun]

339
31:43.579 --> 31:44.339
Oh?

340
31:44.719 --> 31:46.139
You're still awake?

341
31:47.069 --> 31:48.369
Where have you been?

342
31:48.559 --> 31:50.509
I went to talk to Nan.

343
31:51.549 --> 31:52.659
Have I told you

344
31:52.669 --> 31:54.139
I've already fired Nan?

345
31:54.159 --> 31:55.949
And I'm going to sue her, too.

346
31:56.149 --> 31:57.459
And she's okay with that?

347
31:58.589 --> 31:59.619
Of course not.

348
32:00.359 --> 32:02.559
She even said she'd sue me back.

349
32:02.969 --> 32:04.149
What a waste of my time.

350
32:05.519 --> 32:06.759
Thank you, Nadear,

351
32:08.269 --> 32:10.669
for everything you've done for me

352
32:11.139 --> 32:12.449
and our restaurant.

353
32:14.159 --> 32:14.939
From now on,

354
32:14.949 --> 32:17.379
I'll be the best friend you could ever ask for.

355
32:46.579 --> 32:48.459
Can we talk, Nan?

356
32:52.159 --> 32:54.959
I want to see you one last time,

357
32:54.979 --> 32:56.549
and I won't bother you again.

358
33:06.659 --> 33:09.729
[Third Person]

359
33:10.728 --> 33:13.788
[Third Person]

360
33:21.488 --> 33:22.198
So?

361
33:22.688 --> 33:24.858
Hasn't your girlfriend hurt me enough already?

362
33:25.398 --> 33:26.478
Nan,

363
33:26.788 --> 33:29.188
you were the one who stole from Nadear and me.

364
33:29.438 --> 33:31.288
So you found out about Sun...

365
33:31.538 --> 33:32.388
and Nadear,

366
33:32.398 --> 33:33.628
and you still talk to me like this?

367
33:36.208 --> 33:37.208
I knew it.

368
33:37.998 --> 33:40.868
How can an ordinary conversation compare to pillow talk?

369
33:43.478 --> 33:44.408
Nan,

370
33:44.798 --> 33:46.778
I called you out here

371
33:46.798 --> 33:48.108
so we could settle things properly

372
33:48.588 --> 33:50.628
and you'd finally stop pestering Nadear.

373
33:50.988 --> 33:51.988
What the hell?

374
33:52.508 --> 33:55.068
After that slap, I never did anything to her again.

375
33:55.548 --> 33:57.598
I sold her my shares

376
33:58.288 --> 33:59.998
and let her deduct the amount from what I still owed her.

377
34:00.898 --> 34:02.798
Nadear said she came to settle things with you.

378
34:02.988 --> 34:04.588
And weren't you going to sue her back?

379
34:04.608 --> 34:05.488
Chris,

380
34:05.808 --> 34:07.588
don't be so stupid.

381
34:08.688 --> 34:10.088
Your girlfriend

382
34:10.098 --> 34:11.408
is one hell of a schemer.

383
34:11.668 --> 34:13.178
Who's gonna do anything to her?

384
34:14.288 --> 34:15.118
Oh...

385
34:15.688 --> 34:18.408
I guess only an idiot like you

386
34:18.788 --> 34:19.748
would believe her.

387
34:22.088 --> 34:23.178
What a fucking waste of my time.

388
34:24.108 --> 34:25.108
Nan,

389
34:25.588 --> 34:26.958
don't you ever talk about Nadear like that again.

390
34:28.248 --> 34:28.868
Let go!

391
34:29.608 --> 34:30.288
Let me go!

392
34:33.888 --> 34:35.688
Is this what you want?

393
34:37.428 --> 34:38.428
Fine.

394
34:39.908 --> 34:40.908
Nan, I...

395
34:44.258 --> 34:45.988
You two are both pieces of shit.

396
34:48.598 --> 34:49.698
Don't bother me again!

397
34:59.108 --> 35:00.698
I bought this for you.

398
35:04.518 --> 35:05.198
Wait!

399
35:09.888 --> 35:10.568
Chris!

400
35:17.428 --> 35:21.098
[Emergency Room]

401
35:24.948 --> 35:25.988
Are you alright, Chris?

402
35:27.688 --> 35:28.698
I'm okay.

403
35:29.198 --> 35:30.598
Thanks for helping me.

404
35:31.688 --> 35:32.688
Good thing

405
35:32.718 --> 35:34.188
I got there early.

406
35:35.988 --> 35:37.678
What did you want to tell me?

407
35:38.388 --> 35:39.508
Just say it.

408
35:41.288 --> 35:43.298
About your memories...

409
35:44.588 --> 35:45.698
I told you

410
35:46.298 --> 35:47.688
I remembered everything.

411
35:49.698 --> 35:50.898
Are you sure?

412
35:52.468 --> 35:54.498
When you said you remembered everything,

413
35:55.698 --> 35:57.688
were there really no unanswered questions left?

414
36:02.098 --> 36:03.388
What are you trying to say?

415
36:06.588 --> 36:07.488
Chris.

416
36:13.998 --> 36:14.888
Sun.

417
36:16.558 --> 36:17.878
It's nothing, Nadear.

418
36:18.098 --> 36:19.788
Sun brought me here.

419
36:25.788 --> 36:26.898
Let's go home, then.

420
36:28.098 --> 36:30.178
The police have arrested Nan.

421
36:30.898 --> 36:32.788
Don't do this again, Chris.

422
36:33.878 --> 36:35.978
Can't I do something for you for a change?

423
36:36.988 --> 36:38.718
You've already done so much for me.

424
36:45.108 --> 36:45.868
Miss.

425
36:49.588 --> 36:51.508
We used to be close in high school, weren't we?

426
36:52.988 --> 36:54.288
You know me well,

427
36:56.688 --> 36:58.378
so don't act like we're strangers.

428
37:06.388 --> 37:07.668
Nice hair, Nadear.

429
37:21.798 --> 37:22.798
Chris,

430
37:24.298 --> 37:25.298
your wound...

431
37:29.888 --> 37:31.078
I'm fine.

432
37:31.188 --> 37:32.408
I'll go rest up.

433
37:33.798 --> 37:35.398
What were you talking about with Sun?

434
37:40.888 --> 37:41.888
It's nothing.

435
37:42.298 --> 37:44.208
I just thanked her for helping me.

436
37:44.998 --> 37:46.788
Then let's go see Dr. Jeen

437
37:47.088 --> 37:48.748
once you feel better.

438
37:49.108 --> 37:49.788
Hm?

439
37:50.998 --> 37:52.888
Maybe you can't love me

440
37:53.088 --> 37:55.668
because you feel guilty.

441
37:56.888 --> 37:58.828
I want you to get therapy

442
37:59.898 --> 38:02.198
so maybe we can fall in love again.

443
38:32.468 --> 38:33.688
Thanks for coming.

444
38:35.878 --> 38:37.278
Let's put an end to this

445
38:39.988 --> 38:41.778
once and for all, okay?

446
38:43.488 --> 38:44.698
The reason you came here...

447
38:45.488 --> 38:48.428
is that you still have doubts, right?

448
38:49.298 --> 38:51.088
Just get to the point.

449
38:52.708 --> 38:54.708
I don't want to make the same mistake again.

450
38:56.498 --> 38:57.888
Neither do I.

451
39:02.088 --> 39:03.088
Chris...

452
39:04.498 --> 39:06.388
I lost my memory once.

453
39:09.088 --> 39:11.598
I thought I could remember everything again,

454
39:15.188 --> 39:16.748
but that wasn't the case.

455
39:18.008 --> 39:19.108
Perhaps

456
39:20.688 --> 39:22.998
hearing about past events

457
39:23.748 --> 39:26.088
could give you false memories.

458
39:29.518 --> 39:30.868
Are you saying

459
39:31.488 --> 39:33.608
the memories I got back

460
39:34.798 --> 39:36.178
aren't real?

461
39:43.398 --> 39:45.098
This isn't funny, Sun.

462
39:47.878 --> 39:50.888
If you're trying to convince me to believe something this ridiculous,

463
39:52.568 --> 39:53.568
please stop.

464
40:04.608 --> 40:06.198
Do you really believe

465
40:07.288 --> 40:08.598
our relationship...

466
40:10.838 --> 40:13.088
was just a fleeting romance

467
40:14.288 --> 40:16.598
you never wanted in the first place?

468
40:18.918 --> 40:20.668
Is that really what you believe?

469
40:35.168 --> 40:37.998
If it was something more than that,

470
40:40.288 --> 40:43.298
can you trust me one last time?

471
40:48.798 --> 40:52.378
I want you to remember everything yourself.

472
40:58.988 --> 41:00.598
Remember everything myself?

473
41:04.318 --> 41:05.268
How?

474
41:07.148 --> 41:08.488
Go find Tangdong.

475
41:12.758 --> 41:13.978
"Tangdong" is the name of someone

476
41:13.988 --> 41:15.888
who might be able to help you remember.

477
41:16.988 --> 41:18.188
That's enough, Sun.

478
41:20.368 --> 41:22.388
I really want to end this.

479
41:28.888 --> 41:30.088
Do you know why

480
41:31.088 --> 41:33.008
I didn't take you

481
41:33.028 --> 41:35.228
to meet Tangdong?

482
41:41.288 --> 41:42.888
What are you trying to pull this time?

483
41:44.098 --> 41:46.388
I want to end this, too.

484
41:47.048 --> 41:49.288
But you have to remember

485
41:50.288 --> 41:52.878
the truth yourself.

486
42:15.708 --> 42:16.588
Tangdong?

487
42:19.438 --> 42:20.588
Who's that?

488
42:28.248 --> 42:30.428
Who... are you?

489
42:34.388 --> 42:35.298
Uh...

490
42:35.898 --> 42:36.998
I...

491
42:39.168 --> 42:40.918
Just kidding, you dummy.

492
42:41.178 --> 42:41.828
Oh my God, Chris!

493
42:41.848 --> 42:43.468
I miss you so much!

494
43:06.258 --> 43:07.468
What happened?

495
43:08.208 --> 43:09.208
Where is Chris?

496
43:10.178 --> 43:11.178
I don't know.

497
43:12.458 --> 43:15.358
She texted me saying she had something urgent to take care of.

498
43:15.478 --> 43:16.608
Don't worry.

499
43:17.988 --> 43:20.188
She didn't even answer my call.

500
43:23.998 --> 43:25.588
She'll be back soon.

501
43:27.948 --> 43:29.168
I'm scared.

502
43:30.488 --> 43:31.618
You said

503
43:31.628 --> 43:34.598
you could manipulate Chris' memories

504
43:35.188 --> 43:37.878
because she lost her memories.

505
43:38.308 --> 43:40.158
Whatever information we feed her,

506
43:40.178 --> 43:41.138
her brain

507
43:41.148 --> 43:43.978
will fill in the gaps to make sense of it.

508
43:45.478 --> 43:46.428
That's right.

509
43:47.398 --> 43:49.288
The human brain is complex.

510
43:49.788 --> 43:51.578
Her amnesia

511
43:51.728 --> 43:52.908
is like being lost,

512
43:53.088 --> 43:54.688
with all these doors around her.

513
43:55.488 --> 43:57.688
And until she finds the door that leads to the truth,

514
43:57.848 --> 44:00.078
her brain is ready to imagine things

515
44:00.098 --> 44:02.888
or create new memories based on what we feed her.

516
44:03.368 --> 44:05.388
That's why I tried...

517
44:06.988 --> 44:08.888
to keep her from seeing anyone.

518
44:12.378 --> 44:13.208
Nadear,

519
44:14.078 --> 44:15.598
even if she does meet someone,

520
44:17.338 --> 44:19.288
she still might not remember.

521
44:27.078 --> 44:29.658
[Third Person]

522
44:31.108 --> 44:33.748
[Third Person]

523
44:47.288 --> 44:48.058
Chris,

524
44:52.478 --> 44:53.628
you're back?

525
45:00.638 --> 45:02.248
Where have you been?

526
45:03.248 --> 45:05.378
I went to see someone named Tangdong.

527
45:06.958 --> 45:08.228
Do you know her?

528
45:10.948 --> 45:12.458
A close friend

529
45:12.468 --> 45:14.168
who knows everything about me,

530
45:16.148 --> 45:17.338
you,

531
45:19.458 --> 45:20.438
and Sun.

532
45:27.008 --> 45:29.348
You lost your memories, too?

533
45:30.058 --> 45:30.778
Whoa...

534
45:30.938 --> 45:32.238
This is straight out of a movie.

535
45:33.038 --> 45:33.778
Here.

536
45:38.248 --> 45:39.538
Several months ago,

537
45:39.748 --> 45:41.428
Sun ran into me.

538
45:41.738 --> 45:43.408
I showed her the photo album,

539
45:43.428 --> 45:44.428
and that made her remember.

540
45:51.058 --> 45:52.748
Aren't there any photos of Nadear?

541
45:54.738 --> 45:55.738
Nadear?

542
45:56.838 --> 45:58.188
Your best friend?

543
45:59.748 --> 46:02.318
She was in a different class in high school,

544
46:02.758 --> 46:04.028
so there aren't many photos of her.

545
46:05.448 --> 46:06.678
I didn't take many photos

546
46:06.688 --> 46:08.598
in middle school.

547
46:08.618 --> 46:09.328
If I had,

548
46:09.338 --> 46:11.148
you'd have a lot of photos with Nadear.

549
46:18.338 --> 46:19.338
What about Sun?

550
46:21.448 --> 46:22.628
Sun...

551
46:22.648 --> 46:24.228
she transferred to our school in 11th grade.

552
46:24.588 --> 46:25.738
She was the new kid.

553
46:26.098 --> 46:28.228
Then she joined our group.

554
46:28.538 --> 46:30.368
We had so much fun back then.

555
46:30.628 --> 46:32.338
She was really close to me.

556
46:33.498 --> 46:34.768
Mm...

557
46:35.048 --> 46:36.248
But you two didn't start dating

558
46:36.258 --> 46:38.638
until... your first or second year of university.

559
46:39.248 --> 46:40.328
Sun told me

560
46:40.338 --> 46:41.778
not to tell anyone about your relationship,

561
46:42.158 --> 46:43.728
because she didn't want her family to find out.

562
46:43.948 --> 46:45.098
And look how that turned out.

563
46:45.358 --> 46:47.548
You both lost your memories.

564
46:47.568 --> 46:49.148
Good thing I still remember.

565
46:55.468 --> 46:56.548
Do you know her?

566
46:58.128 --> 46:59.128
Tangdong.

567
47:01.938 --> 47:03.138
Of course.

568
47:03.658 --> 47:05.938
Tangdong was in our class, too.

569
47:07.158 --> 47:08.348
No!

570
47:11.058 --> 47:13.218
Stop lying already, Nadear!

571
47:16.638 --> 47:17.638
You too, Doc.

572
47:18.448 --> 47:20.018
What did you do to my memories?

573
47:21.038 --> 47:21.748
Huh?!

574
47:22.538 --> 47:23.648
What did you do?!

575
47:24.128 --> 47:26.338
Chris... calm down.

576
47:41.148 --> 47:42.738
Did you go to see her again?

577
47:44.938 --> 47:47.138
She must have messed with your head again.

578
47:49.548 --> 47:50.238
No,

579
47:51.338 --> 47:53.068
I went to see Tangdong myself.

580
47:53.998 --> 47:55.828
And I told Sun to come here.

581
47:58.138 --> 48:00.538
Sun used to live here, right?

582
48:13.848 --> 48:16.538
I can't remember my relationship with Sun

583
48:19.548 --> 48:21.628
because you and Dr. Jeen

584
48:22.858 --> 48:24.778
rewrote my memories of Sun,

585
48:29.138 --> 48:30.928
turning them into memories of my relationship with you.

586
48:41.548 --> 48:42.548
Chris...

587
48:45.248 --> 48:48.448
We were just friends this entire time.

588
48:53.828 --> 48:55.378
Somchai, why did you pick on my friend?

589
48:55.838 --> 48:56.428
What?

590
48:56.438 --> 48:57.498
I didn't do anything.

591
48:57.648 --> 48:59.338
She just cried for no reason.

592
48:59.358 --> 49:00.578
What's that in your hand, then?

593
49:00.608 --> 49:02.518
You won't even let me have a bite, you meanie!

594
49:02.848 --> 49:03.908
Take it back, then!

595
49:03.928 --> 49:05.898
You already bit a chunk out of it!

596
49:05.928 --> 49:07.668
Stop picking on my friend!

597
49:08.548 --> 49:09.658
Ugh!

598
49:12.748 --> 49:14.528
It's alright, I'll buy you a new one.

599
49:16.438 --> 49:17.618
Here, take this.

600
49:34.748 --> 49:37.408
Did you know Aom and Nam from my class

601
49:37.638 --> 49:38.738
are dating now?

602
49:40.238 --> 49:41.338
How would I know?

603
49:41.358 --> 49:43.038
I'm not even in your class.

604
49:44.418 --> 49:45.848
But isn't Aom into guys?

605
49:49.038 --> 49:50.638
Probably not anymore.

606
49:51.748 --> 49:54.088
So... how do you feel about

607
49:54.098 --> 49:55.608
Aom dating a girl?

608
49:57.958 --> 49:59.058
I'm fine with it.

609
49:59.078 --> 50:00.128
It's kinda sweet.

610
50:01.638 --> 50:03.648
So, if a girl flirted with you,

611
50:03.668 --> 50:05.088
would you be okay with that?

612
50:06.858 --> 50:08.448
What are you talking about?

613
50:08.468 --> 50:09.728
I wouldn't want that.

614
50:09.758 --> 50:11.298
I'm not even into girls.

615
50:34.438 --> 50:35.048
Here.

616
50:36.348 --> 50:37.838
Did you buy these to give to people?

617
50:38.498 --> 50:39.138
No,

618
50:39.158 --> 50:40.228
they're offerings to the Buddha.

619
50:41.438 --> 50:43.438
Then no thanks. I don't want to take one meant for Buddha.

620
50:45.738 --> 50:47.448
This one isn't an offering.

621
50:48.048 --> 50:49.648
I bought this for you.

622
51:00.608 --> 51:01.348
Wait!

623
51:01.428 --> 51:02.138
Chris!

624
51:06.328 --> 51:06.938
Huh?

625
51:17.158 --> 51:18.628
I've always thought of you

626
51:19.908 --> 51:22.328
as one of my closest friends.

627
51:24.598 --> 51:25.448
No,

628
51:30.638 --> 51:33.238
I was never your friend.

629
51:37.898 --> 51:38.848
I...

630
51:42.448 --> 51:44.538
I've always loved you.

631
51:46.468 --> 51:48.848
Is this how you treat someone you love?!

632
51:50.838 --> 51:53.648
You changed your hairstyle and hair color to look like Sun.

633
51:55.138 --> 51:57.748
You stole my memories with Sun.

634
52:03.648 --> 52:05.098
You hypnotized me...

635
52:07.738 --> 52:10.038
into remembering you instead of Sun.

636
52:14.348 --> 52:15.438
In the end,

637
52:17.298 --> 52:18.958
I'm the one who's broken!

638
52:18.978 --> 52:21.328
You broke me!!

639
52:27.358 --> 52:28.628
And you know what?

640
52:29.938 --> 52:31.938
I really hated myself.

641
52:33.348 --> 52:34.578
I hated myself for loving you

642
52:34.588 --> 52:36.928
and holding you dear in my memories.

643
52:39.538 --> 52:41.858
But when I'm with you...

644
52:42.598 --> 52:46.248
I feel terrible every time we touch!

645
52:49.428 --> 52:51.208
I could only think of

646
52:51.238 --> 52:54.828
and yearn for whatever the hell I'd never be able to find!

647
53:00.158 --> 53:01.148
Did you know?

648
53:01.928 --> 53:04.458
You didn't just take away the woman I loved.

649
53:07.138 --> 53:10.618
You took away my closest friend, too!

650
53:11.028 --> 53:12.728
How could you be so cruel, Nadear?!

651
53:12.748 --> 53:14.778
How could you do this to me?

652
53:15.768 --> 53:16.628
Chris!

653
53:18.048 --> 53:20.338
I took away the woman you love?

654
53:22.038 --> 53:24.298
She was the one who left you!

655
53:27.748 --> 53:31.058
When you were on the brink of death and lost your memories,

656
53:33.238 --> 53:36.098
the woman you loved was the one who left you!

657
53:38.598 --> 53:41.538
I was the one who always stayed by your side.

658
53:43.938 --> 53:46.448
But you kept thinking only about her!

659
53:46.468 --> 53:48.428
What else was I supposed to do?!

660
53:52.678 --> 53:54.088
Tell her, Sun!

661
53:55.148 --> 53:58.008
Tell her you were the one who left Chris first!

662
54:11.308 --> 54:12.318
Is this

663
54:14.728 --> 54:17.018
what you've been trying to apologize to me for?

664
